{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1792307160, "covers_from": "2026-10-18T07:06:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-18T07:07:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1792307220, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:06:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34436, "sprite_key": "turtle_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "其他", "content": "拜託我的市長沈柏洋，要好好吃飯，不要太累了！！", "display_name": "大安代表 No.34,436", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:06:08+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 17422, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "其他", "content": "身為城市門面的台北車站，沈市長會怎麼處理北車遊民的問題！", "display_name": "中正代表 No.17,422", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:06:17+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10774, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "能不能機車停車格多一些，機車才是真正台北辛苦人的腳", "display_name": "萬華代表 Lee", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:06:25+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 31130, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "台大醫院前無煙人行道，還是很多人無視表示警告，希望未來市長加強取締，謝謝", "display_name": "中正代表 No.31,130", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-18T07:06:37+00:00", "duration_seconds": 23, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 54480, "sprite_key": "elephant_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "其他", "content": "趕快把站在牆壁上的甘蔗，用一個盆子裝土，把它種起來發芽。修正上次我的發言不要切斷就原裝一整種土即可。", "display_name": "松山代表 No.54,480", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 17422, "sprite_key": "elephant_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.17,422", "district": "zhongzheng", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 10774, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 Lee", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "fr